Subject: [PATCH] fix(interaction): acknowledge block placement after server
 updates

Java acknowledges a predicted placement before the Bedrock server has applied it, which can leave the client showing a temporary ghost block. Track the clicked and placed positions, wait briefly after an authoritative update, and use a bounded timeout when no update arrives.
